- important decisions and changes of direction;
- discoveries;
- work completed;
- work still pending;
- new projects/branches/prompts created or proposed;
- people/projects/systems mentioned where they materially affect future work.

Separate clearly:

**FACT FROM THIS PAGE / INFERENCE / UNKNOWN.**

Do not silently turn inference into history.

### 2. Audit the Git-TURN protocol

Determine from THIS PAGE what Git/Git-TURN protocol was established or requested.

Check the **actual Git repository**, not ChatGPT memory.

Identify:

- repository/repositories involved;
- current repo structure;
- protocol files already present;
- commits already made;
- commit SHAs;
