**J. NEXT-PAGE HANDOVER** — produce a concise prompt I can paste into the new "Personal Thought / Morning Activity" page so that page can read Git and establish its historical baseline without depending on ChatGPT memory.

Most importantly: **do not tell me something has been preserved unless you can show where it was preserved and the corresponding Git evidence.**
